            <ArticleTitle>Management of a patient with giant aneurysms in the popliteal and coronary arteries.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>515-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1093/icvts/ivv372</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Coexistence of multiple peripheric arterial and coronary artery aneurysms of different sizes is extremely rare in young adults. We present a case of rare giant coronary aneurysm and concurrent giant left popliteal aneurysm treated with classical open repair.</AbstractText>
